{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Those who ate</b> — that they feasted." "<b>Crimson</b> — like crimson [of the] second."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The gloss שיתעדנו (\"that they feasted/banqueted\") parses האוכלים as referring to those accustomed to fine dining, now destitute."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:02.472299388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}